{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:51 2026-06-19 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今（19日）午1時許，荔景邨風景樓一名56歲女子報警，指母親（80歲）昏迷床上，面部遭床被蓋住，繼父（71歲）在窗花旁吊頸昏迷，由救護車送院搶救，老婦惜告不治，老翁仍在搶救中。據了解，報案人為死者女兒，已搬出多年，今天端午節回來探望二人，結果揭發悲劇。</p>\n<img alt=\"探員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da9283cdcef94b51244af720df5643bb/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-19_at_14_49_37_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"探員登樓調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10e957e1137cff37963fda4c5d9a5eaa/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-19_at_14_49_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/089345ea1e3c2467bb21955f81558449/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-19_at_14_49_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人居住風景樓多年。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2fb7cba9e74c9e230dc2aecef0ec887/2026-06/02_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a936ae284a8ca6a91d217dc2428923bb/2026-06/03_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf89a52ef6037cfb6e2b2efdff82a92c/2026-06/06_3_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06dd99d63b3c31da8ff5bf39d9762c7c/2026-06/10_2_8.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T07:18:48.427507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}